BUG-008 repro #2: isolating "first position" vs "id value 1" - ack on id 2 and 3 works, id 1 does not
Date: 2026-10-14, tool: ad-hoc diagnostic script against framework driver (fresh hard reset, logged in)

> alert ack all
  W853 no unacknowledged alerts
> alert clear
  I (14470) sentry: [CIC] cleared
> alert test info
  I (15640) sentry: [CIC #1 INFO] test: test alert
> alert test warning
  W (16760) sentry: [CIC #2 WARNING] test: test alert
> alert test info
  I (17870) sentry: [CIC #3 INFO] test: test alert
> alert list
  I (19030) sentry: [CIC] 3 alerts, 3 unacknowledged:
  I (19030) sentry:   #1   12:05:24 INFO     * test    test alert
  I (19030) sentry:   #2   12:05:25 WARNING  * test    test alert
  I (19030) sentry:   #3   12:05:26 INFO     * test    test alert

--- ack #2 and #3 individually: both succeed ---
> alert ack 2
